# Effigy Shoals (CIPlay effigy_shoals): The Lullaby Frequency's third island, quest "Count Them Again". The shoal at
# 1.2 m; channels on 90/210/330 degrees from 13 m out; effigies on rings of 20 and 28 m round bars on 30/150/270
# degrees (the south bar's middle ones at 0 -20 and 0 -28: walk up x 2.6); the circle at 0 0, the tallest effigy 0 6;
# the landing 0 -34, the tide marker -3 -32; the east bar's note on a crate at 22 8.
island Effigy Shoals
offset 0 0
expect step 0
expect title Count Them Again
wait 3
expect shown effin
expect hidden effout
walk 2.6 -40 to 2.6 -35
zone landing
expect step 1
read Tide marker
expect step 2
walk 2.6 -30 to 2.6 -8 to 0 -2 h=1.2
zone circle
expect hidden effin
expect shown effout
expect step 3
read Choir hymn sheet
expect story hymn 1
expect step 4
walk 4 2 to 14 6 to 20 7 h=1.2
read Who made them
expect done
open Choir's offering basket
